From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Georg Lehmann <dadschoorse@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 07:52:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] radv: fix lower_array_layer_round_even condition

It seems like with conformant_trunc_coord, the layer component is always
rounded, and without it, it's always truncated. The TRUNC_COORD sampler bit
has no impact.

Fixes: 200555fd3b2 ("radv: improve lower_array_layer_round_even condition")
Closes: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/work_items/16128

Reviewed-by: Samuel Pitoiset <samuel.pitoiset@gmail.com>
Reviewed-by: Rhys Perry <pendingchaos02@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 3261364cab95877988e0bcf767e5f68c03f35652)

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/44168>
(cherry picked from commit 2d7fa0ba789b1068b3978bde6d539cd5bd19e030)
---
 src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline.c | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline.c b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline.c
index e4731f3d752..6e7f459f2e3 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_pipeline.c
@@ -355,8 +355,7 @@ radv_postprocess_nir(const struct radv_compiler_info *compiler_info, const struc
    NIR_PASS(_, stage->nir, ac_nir_lower_tex_coords,
             &(ac_nir_lower_tex_coords_options){
                .gfx_level = gfx_level,
-               .lower_array_layer_round_even =
-                  !compiler_info->ac->conformant_trunc_coord && !compiler_info->key.disable_trunc_coord,
+               .lower_array_layer_round_even = !compiler_info->ac->conformant_trunc_coord,
                .fix_derivs_in_divergent_cf = stage->stage == MESA_SHADER_FRAGMENT && !use_llvm,
                .max_wqm_vgprs = 64, // TODO: improve spiller and RA support for linear VGPRs
             });
-- 
